  'Trabzon & Black Sea Turkey Travel Guide 2026: Attractions, Road Trips, Car Rentals & Offline App',
  '{"title":"Trabzon & Black Sea Turkey Travel Guide 2026: Attractions, Road Trips, Car Rentals & Offline App","slug":"trabzon-travel-guide-app-tourism-turkey-2026","content":"\n    <div class=\"article-rich-text\" style=\"font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\">\n      <!-- Hero Banner -->\n      <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #047857 50%, #0284c7 100%); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px 28px; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 36px; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.3); text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <span style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 800; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n          🌲 Official 2026 Travel & Exploration Guide\n        </span>\n        <h1 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.3rem); font-weight: 900; margin: 4px 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.35;\">\n          Trabzon & Black Sea Turkey Travel Guide: The Ultimate Explorer Companion\n        </h1>\n        <p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 auto 24px auto; max-width: 720px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n          Discover breathtaking alpine lakes, cliffside Byzantine monasteries, lush tea plantations, and cloud seas with the top-rated offline Android guide app.\n        </p>\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n          <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.trabzon.turkey.travel.guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"background: #ffffff; color: #064e3b; padding: 14px 34px; border-radius: 16px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.05rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);\">\n            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-google-play\"></i> Get Trabzon Travel Guide on Google Play\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Image 1 -->\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom: 36px; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/01_trabzon_app_hero_mockup.jpg\" alt=\"Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide mobile app displayed on smartphone over Uzungol lake view\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 520px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;\">The Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide app: seamless offline GPS exploration across the Black Sea mountains</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.95; color: var(--text-dark);\">\n        Trabzon is the crown jewel of Turkey''s verdant Black Sea (Karadeniz) coast. Dominated by emerald-green peaks, dramatic coastal cliffs, and cascading alpine waterfalls, this region offers an authentic contrast to the bustling streets of Istanbul or the sun-baked beaches of the Mediterranean.\n      </p>\n\n      <h2 style=\"color: #064e3b; font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 36px 0 16px 0;\">Top Attractions You Cannot Miss</h2>\n      \n      <h3>1. Lake Uzungöl (The Long Lake)</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--text-dark);\">\n        Cradled in a deep valley surrounded by virgin spruce forests, Lake Uzungöl is iconic for its twin-minaret mosque reflected in serene waters. Take the uphill trail toward the Garester plateau or hire a wooden boat on the lake.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Image 2 -->\n      <div style=\"margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/02_uzungol_lake_real_view.jpg\" alt=\"Scenic real photograph of Lake Uzungol in Trabzon with mosque and pine covered mountain slopes\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">Lake Uzungöl: The emerald centerpiece of Northern Turkey travel</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>2. Sumela Monastery in Altındere National Park</h3>\n      <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--text-dark);\">\n        Carved directly into the sheer face of Karadağ mountain at 1,200 meters altitude, this 4th-century Byzantine wonder appears suspended in mid-air amidst morning mist and waterfalls.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Image 3 -->\n      <div style=\"margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/03_sumela_monastery_cliff_real.jpg\" alt=\"Sumela Monastery carved into cliff face in Trabzon Turkey\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">The cliff-hanging Sumela Monastery in Altındere Valley</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Image 4 -->\n      <div style=\"margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/04_ayder_plateau_waterfalls_real.jpg\" alt=\"Ayder Plateau with alpine chalets and waterfalls in Rize\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">Ayder Plateau in Rize: Wooden chalets and roaring mountain cascades</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Image 7 -->\n      <div style=\"margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/07_car_rental_roadtrip_offline_gps.jpg\" alt=\"Driving rental car on scenic mountain highway with offline GPS travel guide app\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\">\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">Road-tripping through Trabzon: Pre-downloaded offline maps protect you from dead cellular zones</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px; text-align: center; margin: 36px 0;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 800; color: #064e3b; margin: 0 0 10px 0;\">Download Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide Free</h3>\n        <p style=\"font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto 20px auto;\">\n          Get turn-by-turn navigation, curated dining recommendations, hidden waterfall spots, and emergency contacts offline.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.trabzon.turkey.travel.guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"background: #047857; color: #fff; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\">\n          <i class=\"fa-brands fa-google-play\"></i> Install from Google Play\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  "}',
  1791541436483,
  1791541436483,
  1791541436483
);

