  '{"title":"Guide de Voyage Trabzon 2026 : Le Lac Uzungöl, Monastère de Sümela, Location de Voiture & Application Hors-Ligne","slug":"trabzon-travel-guide-app-tourism-turkey-2026","content":"\n    <div class=\"article-rich-text\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; line-height: 1.85; color: #1e293b;\">\n\n      <!-- Hero Banner Component -->\n      <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #064e3b 0%, #047857 50%, #0284c7 100%); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px 28px; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 36px; box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.3); text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 22px;\">\n          <span style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block;\">\n            🌲 Guide Officiel de la Mer Noire en Turquie 2026\n          </span>\n          <h1 style=\"color: #ffffff; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.35rem); font-weight: 900; margin: 4px 0 10px 0; line-height: 1.35;\">\n            Guide de Voyage Trabzon 2026 : Uzungöl, Sümela & Application Hors-Ligne\n          </h1>\n          <p style=\"color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7;\">\n            Explorez le joyau émeraude de la Turquie : les forêts de conifères, les cascades sauvages, les chalets en bois au bord de la rivière et l''application indispensable <strong>Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide</strong> disponible sur Google Play.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n          <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.trabzon.turkey.travel.guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"background: #ffffff; color: #064e3b !important; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.02rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\">\n            <i class=\"fa-brands fa-google-play\" style=\"font-size: 1.3rem; color: #047857;\"></i>\n            <span>Télécharger sur Google Play</span>\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- App Showcase Image 1 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 36px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/01_trabzon_app_hero_mockup.jpg\" alt=\"Application mobile Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide avec vue sur le lac Uzungol\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 520px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          📱 Interface de l''application Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide avec guidage GPS hors-ligne\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <h2 style=\"color: #064e3b; font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 38px 0 18px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n        1. Les Merveilles Incontournables de Trabzon\n      </h2>\n\n      <!-- Real Image 2 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/02_uzungol_lake_real_view.jpg\" alt=\"Le lac Uzungol à Trabzon avec sa mosquée et ses chalets\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          🏞️ Le lac Uzungöl et sa mosquée emblématique au cœur d''une vallée verdoyante\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- Real Image 3 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/03_sumela_monastery_cliff_real.jpg\" alt=\"Le monastère de Sumela à flanc de falaise dans la vallée d''Altindere\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          🏛️ Le monastère de Sümela : un chef-d''œuvre byzantin spectaculaire suspendu dans les rochers\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- Real Image 4 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/04_ayder_plateau_waterfalls_real.jpg\" alt=\"Plateau d''Ayder à Rize avec cascades et alpages\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          ⛰️ Le plateau d''Ayder : sources thermales naturelles, cascades et chalets traditionnels en bois\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- Real Image 5 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/05_boztepe_trabzon_sunset_real.jpg\" alt=\"Coucher de soleil sur la colline de Boztepe à Trabzon\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          🌅 La colline de Boztepe : vue panoramique sur la Mer Noire à l''heure du thé turc\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- Real Image 6 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/06_hamsikoy_nature_valley_real.jpg\" alt=\"Village de Hamsikoy dans la vallee de Zigana\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          🍮 Village de Hamsiköy : la capitale du riz au lait caramélisé au four (Sütlaç)\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <h2 style=\"color: #064e3b; font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 38px 0 18px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n        2. Location de Voiture & Navigation Hors-Ligne\n      </h2>\n\n      <!-- Real Image 7 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/07_car_rental_roadtrip_offline_gps.jpg\" alt=\"Road trip en voiture de location à Trabzon avec GPS hors-ligne\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          🚗 Conduite sereine sur les routes sinueuses des montagnes avec le guidage GPS autonome\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- App Download Banner Image 8 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 36px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.trabzon.turkey.travel.guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n          <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/08_google_play_download_trabzon_app.jpg\" alt=\"Télécharger Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide sur Google Play\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 480px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          📲 Application gratuite Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide sur Google Play notée 4.9 ★\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- CTA Box -->\n      <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #064e3b 100%); border-radius: 20px; padding: 34px 26px; color: white; text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">\n          Prêt pour un voyage inoubliable à Trabzon ?\n        </h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto 24px auto; line-height: 1.7;\">\n          Téléchargez gratuitement l''application <strong>Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide</strong> sur Google Play et profitez d''une navigation précise sans consommer vos données mobiles.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.trabzon.turkey.travel.guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"background: #10b981; color: white !important; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);\">\n          <i class=\"fa-brands fa-google-play\"></i>\n          <span>Installer gratuitement sur Android</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  "}',
