00px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          🍮 Dorf Hamsiköy — die Heimat des berühmten ofenfrischen Milchreises (Sütlaç)\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <h2 style=\"color: #064e3b; font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 38px 0 18px 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\n        2. Mietwagen & Offline-Navigation in den Bergen\n      </h2>\n\n      <!-- Real Image 7 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 32px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/07_car_rental_roadtrip_offline_gps.jpg\" alt=\"Roadtrip mit Mietwagen in Trabzon und Offline-GPS\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 500px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          🚗 Sicheres Fahren auf kurvenreichen Bergstraßen dank autonomer Offline-Navigation\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- App Download Banner Image 8 -->\n      <figure style=\"margin: 36px 0; text-align: center;\">\n        <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.trabzon.turkey.travel.guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n          <img src=\"/public/images/trabzon-app/08_google_play_download_trabzon_app.jpg\" alt=\"Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide auf Google Play herunterladen\" style=\"width: 100%; max-height: 480px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 18px; box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        </a>\n        <figcaption style=\"margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #64748b; font-weight: 600;\">\n          📲 Kostenlose App Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide auf Google Play mit 4,9 ★ Bewertung\n        </figcaption>\n      </figure>\n\n      <!-- CTA Box -->\n      <div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #064e3b 100%); border-radius: 20px; padding: 34px 26px; color: white; text-align: center; margin: 40px 0;\">\n        <h3 style=\"color: white; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">\n          Bereit für Ihre Traumreise nach Trabzon?\n        </h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #e2e8f0; font-size: 1.05rem; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto 24px auto; line-height: 1.7;\">\n          Laden Sie jetzt die App <strong>Trabzon Turkey Travel Guide</strong> kostenlos bei Google Play herunter und reisen Sie entspannt mit Offline-Karten und präzisen GPS-Routen.\n        </p>\n        <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.trabzon.turkey.travel.guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"background: #10b981; color: white !important; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 30px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);\">\n          <i class=\"fa-brands fa-google-play\"></i>\n          <span>Kostenlos auf Google Play laden</span>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  "}',
